<StanceStatePage state="vt">
  <p>This webpage houses the responses to 5 questions
    crafted by the Vermont Stance on Science team.</p>
    <p>Only official candidates who will appear on ballots were contacted.</p>
    <p>Candidates were contacted in June 2026 (with a follow-up to those who
    did not initially respond) and given the opportunity to answer all questions. Only the responses of candidates who answered the questions are
    included. None of the candidates' responses were modified in any way before
    being published on this resource page.</p>

    <p><u>For the <strong>August 2026 Primary Election and November 2026 General
    Election</strong></u>, only candidates in
    the following elections were contacted<sup>1</sup>:</p>

    <div>
      <details class="stance-race-group">
        <summary>US House of Representatives</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>Republican Primary for VT Representative for At-Large District</li>
            <li>Democratic Primary for VT Representative for At-Large District</li>
            <li>Independent Primary for VT Representative for At-Large District</li>
          </ul>
      </details>
      <details class="stance-race-group">
        <summary>Vermont State Senate</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>Republican & Democratic Primaries for Addison District, Bennington District, Caledonia District, Chittenden Central District, Chittenden North District, Chittenden Southeast District, Essex District, Franklin District, Grand Isle District, Lamoille District, Orange District, Rutland District, Washington District, Windham District, Windsor District</li>
          </ul>
      </details>
      <details class="stance-race-group">
