          <ul>
            <li>Republican & Democratic Primaries for Addison Districts 1-5, Bennington Districts 1-5, Rutland District, Caledonia-Essex District, Caledonia-Washington District, Caledonia Districts 1-3, Chittenden-Franklin District, Chittenden Districts 1-25, Franklin Districts 1-8, Isle-Chittenden District, Lamoille-Washington District, Lamoille Districts 1-3, Orange-Caledonia District, Orange-Washington-Addison District, Orange Districts 1-3, Orleans-Lamoille District, Orleans Districts 1-4, Rutland-Bennington District, Rutland-Windsor District, Rutland Districts 1-11, Washington Districts 1-6, Washington-Chittenden District, Windham-Windsor-Bennington District, Windham Districts 1-9, Windsor-Addison District, Windsor-Orange Districts 1-2, Windsor-Windham District, Windsor Districts 1-6</li>
